@startuml 06-takeover-cancel-revocation
title Sequence 06 - Tab takeover, candidate cancel and HR revocation
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor Candidate
actor HR
participant "Tab A (controller)" as TA
participant "Tab B" as TB
participant "HTTP delivery" as H
participant "Interview use case" as A
participant "Access use case" as AC
participant "Execution Lifecycle" as L
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Takeover (BR-CORE-044) ==
Candidate -> TB : open second tab
TB -> H : GET /candidate/executions/{id}
H --> TB : isCurrentController false (read-only)
Candidate -> TB : take over
TB -> H : POST .../takeover {controllerId, expectedVersion}\nX-Interview-Controller
H -> A : Takeover
A -> DB : update controller (versioned)
alt version matches
  H --> TB : 200 {isCurrentController true, controllerVersion + 1}
else stale
  H --> TB : 409 CIN_CONTROLLER_CONFLICT
end
TA -> H : any controlled action
H --> TA : 403 CIN_NOT_CONTROLLER

== Early stop (BR-CORE-045) ==
Candidate -> TB : confirm cancel
TB -> H : POST .../cancel {expectedVersion}
H -> A : Cancel
A -> L : Cancel (reason candidate_early_stop)
L -> DB : lock execution, commit CANCELLED
H --> TB : 200 execution CANCELLED
note right : terminal state is never relabelled

== HR revocation (BR-CORE-038, 055) ==
HR -> H : POST /admin/interview-assignments/{id}/revocation\n(cookie, origin, CSRF, empty body)
H -> AC : RevokeAssignmentAccess
AC -> DB : set access_revoked_at (trusted clock) only while null
AC -> L : CancelNonterminal (reason access_revoked)
L -> DB : CANCELLED, unless already terminal
H --> HR : 200
Candidate -> H : next candidate request
H --> Candidate : 401, access removed
note over AC, L : a COMPLETED interview is not restarted\nor cancelled (BR-CORE-039).\nSession expiry mid-interview has no driver yet (Q7).
@enduml
